Лидтайм, СКО лидтайма, квоты
Партии и циклы
Выходной коэф. ГП в BOM
Коэф. компонентов СиМ в BOM
Ограничения СЗ
Ограничения по хранению на скл.
Затраты на содержание запаса</bpmn:text>
        </bpmn:textAnnotation>
        <bpmn:textAnnotation id="TextAnnotation_176twac">
          <bpmn:text>Алг. массового редактирования результатов
Отображение сразу после корректировок</bpmn:text>
        </bpmn:textAnnotation>
        <bpmn:textAnnotation id="TextAnnotation_073u1c4">
          <bpmn:text>MULTI-STAGE ОПТИМИЗАТОР
Алгоритм расчета целевых компонент запаса</bpmn:text>
        </bpmn:textAnnotation>
        <bpmn:textAnnotation id="TextAnnotation_0pbiv7d">
          <bpmn:text>FROM ITSELF
Periods Between Review
Minimum Internal Service Level
Maximum Internal Service Level
Inventory Holding Cost Rate
Maximum Inventory Violation Cost Rate
Maximum Inventory
Service Level Type
Safety Stock Policy
Stocking Node Type
Source Type
Transport Delivery Type
Production Delivery Type
Distribution Type</bpmn:text>
        </bpmn:textAnnotation>
        <bpmn:textAnnotation id="TextAnnotation_01c5zcs">
          <bpmn:text>FROM SOURCE
Transport Lead Time
Transport Lead Time Variability
Transport Minimum Lot Size
Transport Incremental Lot Size
Production Lead Time
Production Lead Time Variability
Production Minimum Lot Size
Production Incremental Lot Size

SOURCING QUOTAS &amp; BOM
Output Coefficient
Component Coefficient
Location Ratio
Production Ratio
Transport Ratio</bpmn:text>
        </bpmn:textAnnotation>
        <bpmn:textAnnotation id="TextAnnotation_0xqp9b1">
          <bpmn:text>OUTPUT:
Recommended Safety Stock
Merchandise Stock
Propagated Demand Standard Deviation
Average Service Level
Demand Ramp Down Ind
Demand Phase Out Ind</bpmn:text>
        </bpmn:textAnnotation>
        <bpmn:textAnnotation id="TextAnnotation_1nkwr7a">
          <bpmn:text>OUTPUT
Dependent Source To Location Demand Mean
Dependent Source To Location Standard Deviation
Outgoing Source To Location Backlog Mean
Outgoing Source To Location Backlog Standard Deviation
Calculated Production Lead Time
Calculated Production Lead Time Variability
Calculated Production Minimum Lot Size
Calculated Production Incremental Lot Size</bpmn:text>
        </bpmn:textAnnotation>
        <bpmn:textAnnotation id="TextAnnotation_0k8rtxj">
          <bpmn:text>OUTPUT:
Available In Full
Dependent Customer Demand Mean
Dependent Customer Demand Standard Deviation
Lost Customer Demand Mean

Internal Available In Full
Dependent Location to Production Demand Mean
Dependent Location to Production Demand Standard Deviation</bpmn:text>
        </bpmn:textAnnotation>
        <bpmn:textAnnotation id="TextAnnotation_1uh8p90">
          <bpmn:text>OUTPUT:
Dependent Location Demand Mean
Dependent Location Demand Standard Deviation
Internal Available In Full
Outgoing Backlog Mean
Outgoing Backlog Standard
Calculated Lead Time
Calculated Lead Time Variability
Calculated Minimum Lot Size
Calculated Incremental Lot Size</bpmn:text>
        </bpmn:textAnnotation>
        <bpmn:textAnnotation id="TextAnnotation_0tl8ud3">
          <bpmn:text>OUTPUT:
Safety Stock Value
Minimum Stock Value
Target Cycle Stock Value
Average Cycle Stock Value
Target Stock on Hand Value
Average Stock on Hand Value
Target Pipeline Stock Value
Average Pipeline Stock Value
Target Stock in Process Value
Average Stock in Process Value
Target Stock in Transit Value
Average Stock in Transit Value
Target Working Capital
Average Working Capital</bpmn:text>
        </bpmn:textAnnotation>
        <bpmn:textAnnotation id="TextAnnotation_1tl1g5y">
          <bpmn:text>Входные данные для расчета потребности в запасах:
- Волатильность спроса, динамическая величина
- Время выполнения заказа и его отклонения
- Цикл планирования
- Размер партии
- Тип ППМ (MRP)
- Политика по местам хранения
- Источники поставки их квоты
- Мин. и макс. ограничения на величину стр. запаса
- Коэффициенты производственной спецификации

Переменные:
- Внутренние уровни сервиса в каждом внутреннем узле [Продукт-Локация]</bpmn:text>
        </bpmn:textAnnotation>
        <bpmn:textAnnotation id="TextAnnotation_06gv1wu">
          <bpmn:text>OUTPUT:
Propagated Demand Mean
Target Cycle Stock
Average Cycle Stock
Target Stock on Hand
Average Stock on Hand
End on Hand Stock
Target Pipeline Stock
Average Pipeline Stock
Target Stock in Process
Average Stock in Process
Target Stock in Transit
Average Stock in Transit
Reorder Point
Target Inventory Position
Average Inventory Position
Safety Stock Days of Supply
Target on Hand Days of Supply
Average On Hand Days of Supply
End on Hand Stock Days of Supply</bpmn:text>
        </bpmn:textAnnotation>
        <bpmn:textAnnotation id="TextAnnotation_08i1cat">
          <bpmn:text>111</bpmn:text>
        </bpmn:textAnnotation>
